{
  "id": "JHN.7",
  "number": "7",
  "bookId": "JHN",
  "reference": "Yohana 7",
  "verseCount": 53,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "7",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu kodi wutmin",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rumacen, Yesu owotho yu Galili; ato k'omito kidho Yuda, rupiri Joyuda oyido jomito neko go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.23.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jolevi 23:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.16.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 16:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndelo ma kalima pa Joyuda m'ilwoŋo ni ma Wema pa Were onwaŋo orikere cegin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riameno wutmin Yesu jowaco rigo ni, “Eye ka ikidhi Yuda, aka nyaka jofonjirok perin jobino neno tic m'itimo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ongoye ŋata pano tic ma go timo ka mito nike woŋeyere maber. Paka itimo gigipiny me, onyo weyi piny gipi woŋey.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Kada wutmin go bende oyido jok'oyeyo go). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu odwoko jo ni, “Ndiri paran m'otire fodi k'otundo. To riwin hongo je ripo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ji ma piny kinyal dak win, to jodakan, rupiri amena waco rijo nike tim pa joreco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiwegi kidhi win i kalima no, akibino kidh'iye, rupiri hongo paran m'otire fodi k'otundo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owaco rijo ameno to bedo i Galili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu i Kalima ma Kayindi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo wutmin jotieko kadho i kalima, Yesu bende okidho nyaliŋliŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joyuda onwaŋo jorango go i kalima no. Jopenjo ni, “Nikune jalago?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwoŋo madit obedo kwoŋ go i dier lwak ji. Jomegi jowaco ni, “Kole go dhano maber.” Joman ni, “Be, go komo wiy ji.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ongoye ŋat'oluwo kwoŋe kamaler rupiri oyido jolworo Joyuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kalima oyido ni diere kama pek to Yesu kidho i Ot pa Were to cako fonjo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joyuda jobedo gi dhier madwoŋ, ka jowaco ni, “Ŋatin oŋeyo gigipiny kweth ama nedi ma to go k'ofonjere kada?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu odwoko ni, “Gim'afonjo k'obedo aparan won, to wok bongi Ŋat'ooran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋata yeyo timo gima Were yenyo bino ŋeyo k'agima afonjo wok bongi Were kosa ka aluwo gi meni paran won. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole ŋata luwo gi meni pere won temo miyirok dwoŋ. To ŋata mito dwoŋ ri ŋat'ooro go meno otire, aka ongoye gi twodo i go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa omiyo win Cik, k'ameno? To kole ongoye kada ŋat'acel kwoŋ win ma mako Cik no. Raŋo ma wiyenyo nekan?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ji jodwoko ni, “In gi jwogi kwoŋin! Ŋata yenyo nekin ŋa?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu odwoko ni, “Atimo gimoro nyaka acel won to wijoje widhier. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.12.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jolevi 12:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.17.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cak 17:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa ooro win thumirok (k'obedo Musa to kwarere pajo ama jocako), to kole withumo dhano kiri i Sabato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.5.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 5:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo ka nyathi majayac ithumo i Sabato ma kitur Cik pa Musa, raŋo ma wimako nge kodan ni rupiri abotho dhano to bedo maber i Sabato? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikiri witer wac moro cungo kwoŋ nyaka gima nenere gi woko, to kutho wiripo niaŋ tiendi wac m'otire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu a Kristo?",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok i hongo no ji moro ma Yerusalem jowaco ni, “Me k'aŋata jor'adhum joyenyo neko? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neni! Kole go ee luwo i dier ji, aka ongoye kiri ŋata luwo kwoŋe. Kosa jotel joŋeyo nike go a Kristo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole waŋeyo kama jame wok'iye, ma to ka Kristo obin, ongoye ŋata laŋeyo kama go wok'iye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Yesu fodi medere fonjo i Ot pa Were, owaco gi dwonde ma malo ni, “Wiparo ni wiŋeyan, aka wiŋeyo kiri kama awok'iye? To kole akibino ka gi meni paran won. Aka ŋat'ooran obedo jar'adieri. Wikuya go, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to an aŋeyo go, rupiri awok bonge aka go ama ooran.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo jotemo mako go, to ongoye ŋat'oketho cinge kwoŋe, rupiri ndir pere oyido fodi k'otundo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To kad'ameno ji mathoth i dier kitipa no joyeyo go, aka jopenjere ni, “Ka Kristo obin, otim tic madongo loyo ma jalin otieko timo?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "I oro jolweny mako Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Jofarisayo jowinjo ji madit jomwoŋo gigipiny me kwoŋe, jo kodi jotel pa jocway ri Were i wi migam jooro jolweny ma Ot pa Were mako Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu owaco ni, “Abino bedo gi win hongo macek, to agik bongi ŋat'ooran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wibino rangan to wik'onwaŋan; aka kam'akidh'iye wikinyal tundo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joyuda jopenjere wegi kendi gin ni, “Jame cegin kidho kune kama wakinyali nwaŋ'iye go? Kosa go lakidho yu tindin ma piny pa Jogris kama ji mawan man jonitie i iye? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go waco ni wibino rangan to wikibino nwaŋan, kendo ni, ‘Wikinyal tundo kam'akidh'iye.’ Gime dwoŋ mere aŋo?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pi ma mol ma kelo kwo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.23.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jolevi 23:36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndelo macowe ma kalima am'obedo ndelo m'oloyo dwoŋ. I ndelo no, Yesu ocungo to luwo gi dwonde ma malo ni, “Ka nitie moro je ma riyo neko wobin bongan womadhi pi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.47.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eze 47:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.14.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 14:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "paka ondiki ni, ‘Moro je ma yeyan, pi ma mol ma kelo kwo makirum bino mol wok i cunye.’ ” ( ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu owaco ama kwoŋ Cuny Maleŋ ma joma joyeyo go oyido jolalimo rumacen. I hongo no Cuny Maleŋ oyido fodi k'omiy ji, rupiri Yesu oyido fodi k'otiŋ malo i dwoŋ.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tiakirok i dier ji",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ji megi kwoŋ jono jowinjo go munyo waco gime aka jowaco ni, “Ŋati me obedo jatuci wac Were adieri!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joman jowaco ni, “Jame won a Kristo.” To joman jowaco ni, “Kristo nyalo wok nedi i Galili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.7.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 7:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MIC.5.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mika 5:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'ondiki ni Kristo bino bedo nyakwar Daudi, aka ibino nywolo go i Bethelehem, tindi pa Daudi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo tiakirok obedo i dier jo kwoŋ wac ma ŋeyo go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joman oyido jomito mako go, to ongoye ŋat'oketho cinge kwoŋe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jotel pa Joyuda jokwero yeyo Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jolweny jogik bongi jotel pa jocway ri Were i wi migam kodi Jofarisayo, ma jopenjo jo ni, “Raŋo ma wikikelo go?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jolweny jowaco ni, “Ongoye ŋata fodi oluwo paka jame luwo!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jofarisayo jopenjo ni, “Nyutho ni go onyo otieko miŋo win bende, k'ameno be? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitie megi kwoŋ jotel mawan kosa Jafarisayo moro ma bende jotieko yeyo go? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To lwak ji me, paka jokuya Cik pa Musa onyo kole Were okwoŋo jo!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.3.1+JHN.3.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 3:1-2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acel kwoŋ Jofarisayo no m'obedo Nikodemo m'oyido otieko kidho neno Yesu con, openjo jowote ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kere ti Cik mawan yeyo wan thumo banja loyo dhano mafodi wakiwinjo wac pere to waniaŋ gima go otimo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jodwoko ni, “Kere ibende iwok yu Galili? Fonjere ye Ndiko Maleŋ, aka inoniaŋ ni jatuci wac Were ongoye ma wok Galili!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
